  {"op":"add-textbox","slide":"SLIDE_5","text":"211.9x","x":35,"y":95,"width":210,"height":110,"font_size":48,"bold":true,"color":"#D4AF37","font_family":"Montserrat","background_color":"#8B1E24","alignment":"center","content_alignment":"MIDDLE"},
  {"op":"add-textbox","slide":"SLIDE_5","text":"Más rápido en respuesta al usuario\n(16.14 ms HTTP 202 vs 3,420 ms Síncrono)","x":35,"y":205,"width":210,"height":55,"font_size":11,"color":"#FFFFFF","font_family":"Roboto","background_color":"#8B1E24","alignment":"center"},
  {"op":"add-textbox","slide":"SLIDE_5","text":"Flujo Asíncrono No Bloqueante:\n1. Estudiante solicita certificado en Astro SSR -> POST /api/v1/certificates/request.\n2. Core Service registra estado QUEUED, publica evento en BullMQ y responde HTTP 202 Accepted en 12.98 ms (p50).\n3. Async Worker (:4002) consume la cola, renderiza el PDF oficial con PDFKit, incrusta QR de verificación (USCO-2026-XXXX) y firma SHA-256.\n4. Almacena el PDF y actualiza el estado a COMPLETED para descarga inmediata.","x":265,"y":95,"width":420,"height":165,"font_size":12,"color":"#F8FAFC","font_family":"Roboto","background_color":"#2D2A37","line_spacing":140},
  {"op":"add-textbox","slide":"SLIDE_5","text":"Garantía de Integridad (OWASP A08): Hash canónico SHA-256 = H(verificationCode | studentCode | docNumber | type | timestamp | salt)","x":35,"y":285,"width":650,"height":75,"font_size":12,"bold":true,"color":"#D4AF37","font_family":"Roboto","background_color":"#0F172A","alignment":"center","content_alignment":"MIDDLE"},
  {"op":"set-notes","slide":"SLIDE_5","text":"Diapositiva 5: Destacar la ganancia de 211.9x en tiempo de respuesta gracias al patrón productor-consumidor con BullMQ y HTTP 202 Accepted."},

